The library calls actually need to be in quotes, otherwise the command line recognizes the parenthesis as special chars.  I created a bash script so I could launch it as an executable on my linux machine:

---------------------

#!/bin/sh
# Shell wrapper for R JGR gui executable.

R -e "library(JGR)" -e "JGR()"

---------------------

